          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("story/trow_story_04-Fall_of_Eldaric.jpg"),
            text: _("So it came to pass that Prince Haldric was forced from his home, never to return. With the help of his father’s noble sacrifice he has escaped through the southern pass. Haldric has left the lands of his home, and before him stretches the vast expanse of the southern kingdoms of his people."),
